pack_artem</a>. Покажем полный перечень работ по разработке многостраничных сайтов и обсудим, как ваш бизнес может зарабатывать больше с помощью правильных маркетинговых инструментов.</div> </div> </div> </div>   </div>"},{"id":"780562451","type":"396","html":"<div id=\"rec780562451\" class=\"r t-rec\" style=\" \" data-animationappear=\"off\" data-record-type=\"396\">  <style>#rec780562451 .t396__artboard {height:7804px;}#rec780562451 .t396__filter {height:7804px;}#rec780562451 .t396__carrier{height:7804px;background-position:center center;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;}@media screen and (max-width:1199px) {#rec780562451 .t396__artboard,#rec780562451 .t396__filter,#rec780562451 .t396__carrier {height:6353px;}#rec780562451 .t396__filter {}#rec780562451 .t396__carrier {background-attachment:scroll;}}@media screen and (max-width:959px) {#rec780562451 .t396__artboard,#rec780562451 .t396__filter,#rec780562451 .t396__carrier {height:2194px;}#rec780562451 .t396__filter {}#rec780562451 .t396__carrier {background-attachment:scroll;}}#rec780562451 .tn-elem[data-elem-id=\"1685121427765\"]{z-index:3;top:2422px;;left:calc(50% - 600px + 21px);;width:1161px;height:auto;}#rec780562451 .tn-elem[data-elem-id=\"1685121427765\"] .tn-atom{background-position:center center;border-width:var(--t396-borderwidth,0);border-style:var(--t396-borderstyle,solid);border-color:var(--t396-bordercolor,transparent);transition:background-color var(--t396-speedhover,0s) ease-in-out,color var(--t396-speedhover,0s) ease-in-out,border-color var(--t396-speedhover,0s) ease-in-out,box-shadow var(--t396-shadowshoverspeed,0.2s) ease-in-out;}@media screen and (max-width:1199px){#rec780562451 .tn-elem[data-elem-id=\"1685121427765\"]{top:1963px;;left:calc(50% - 480px + 10px);;width:941px;height:auto;}}@media screen and (max-width:959px){#rec780562451 .tn-elem[data-elem-id=\"1685121427765\"]{top:667px;;left:calc(50% - 160px + 0px);;width:320px;height:auto;}}#rec78056